  "description": "Do-Bin, the handsome art student, finds himself in the midst of heartbreak and wonders if he'll ever be able to get a good night's rest since his breakup. Jae-Hui, the flower shop owner, has never fallen in love in his life and is uncertain if he'll ever find the one. What will happen when these two unlikely people cross paths? Will they find the answers in each other?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US, edited)",
